## H-1 — LOCKER-04 inv-14: declarative `schema:` missing on 12 folders/notes routes

**Disposition: STILL LIVE.**

Evidence — `grep -Ln "schema:" apps/api/src/routes/folders/*.ts apps/api/src/routes/notes/*.ts`
lists all 12 route files (plus the `shape.ts` helpers, which are not route
declarations) as MISSING `schema:`:
  folders/{batch-create,create,delete,list,update}.ts
  notes/{batch-create,create,delete-all,delete,list,search,update}.ts
Cross-check — every `conversations/*.ts` route file MATCHES `schema:`.

Per-route-class confirmed:
  - 8 body routes — folders/{create,batch-create,delete,update},
    notes/{create,batch-create,delete,update,search}. Each handler already
    `.parse()`s a Zod schema (FolderInputSchema, NoteInputSchema,
    BatchCreateBodySchema, DeleteBodySchema, UpdateBodySchema,
    SearchRequestSchema).
  - 2 querystring routes — folders/list, notes/list. No declared zod
    querystring schema; `parseListQuery((req.query) as ListQuery)` only.
  - 1 body-less route — notes/delete-all (DELETE, no `.parse()`).

